src/letsfly/client.py       fli/search/client.py, fli/search/_concurrency.py (token bucket),
                            fli/search/exceptions.py
src/letsfly/tfs.py          fli/search/_proto.py, fli/search/_tfs.py (build_tfs, page_url),
                            fli/search/flights.py (build_flight_booking_url), fli/core/links.py
src/letsfly/page.py         fli/search/_tfs.py (extract_payload, fetch_payload)
src/letsfly/decode.py       fli/search/_decoders.py, fli/search/_helpers.py,
                            fli/models/google_flights/base.py (FlightLeg, FlightResult)
src/letsfly/search.py       fli/search/flights.py, fli/search/dates.py,
                            fli/search/_tfs.py (apply_client_side_filters), fli/search/_concurrency.py
src/letsfly/params.py       fli/core/parsers.py, fli/core/builders.py, the validators in
                            fli/models/google_flights/base.py, fli/models/google_flights/flights.py
                            and fli/models/google_flights/dates.py
src/letsfly/airports.py     fli/core/airports.py, fli/core/parsers.py (resolve_airport, icao_to_iata)
src/letsfly/models.py       fli/models/google_flights/base.py (utc_today)
src/letsfly/tools.py        search_flights, cheapest_dates and find_airports: fli/mcp/server.py
                            (_execute_date_search, _search_error_message, _find_airports_impl),
                            fli/core/errors.py (format_validation_error)

src/letsfly/data/airports.csv comes from OurAirports (https://ourairports.com/data/, public domain),
downloaded 2026-10-28 and rebuilt with bin/airports.py: airports with an IATA code, their ICAO code,
name, city, country, size and whether they have scheduled service.
